Package: pci-pf-bar-recover-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms (>= 3.0), python3, kmod, xz-utils, zstd, gzip, coreutils, sed, grep, findutils, gawk | mawk
Recommends: linux-headers-generic | linux-headers-amd64, pahole, initramfs-tools
Conflicts: pci-pf-bar-recover-prebuilt
Replaces: pci-pf-bar-recover-prebuilt
Description: best-effort physical PCI BAR recovery using DKMS
 Probes and restores missing physical BARs on unused PCI functions without
 requiring a particular device model or a particular failure cause.
 Defaults to all PCI devices, with an optional root-port list restriction.
 Device failures are logged and skipped; other devices continue.
 Active devices are not relocated; idle subtrees may rebalance windows.
 Default CMP large-BAR preparation is restricted to NVIDIA 20c2/2082.
 Module loading is inert unless execute=1 is explicitly supplied.
 An optional pre-udev initramfs action requires explicit user opt-in.
 Installing this package does not enable the early action.
